    "type": "mc",
    "prompt": "A regular hexagon is drawn inside a circle (its vertices are on the circle). The ratio of the circumference of the circle to the perimeter of the hexagon is",
    "image": "qimages/samf/senior-1997-r2/q07.webp",
    "choices": [
