      },
      {
        "key": "D",
        "text": "8"
      },
      {
        "key": "E",
        "text": "11"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Divisors of 1956",
        "body": "A number $d$ leaves remainder 41 on dividing 1997 exactly when $d>41$ and $d\\mid1997-41=1956$. Now $1956=2^2\\cdot3\\cdot163$, whose divisors are $1,2,3,4,6,12,163,326,489,652,978,1956$. Those greater than 41 are $163,326,489,652,978,1956$: six numbers.\n\n**Answer: (A) 6**"
      }
    ],
