    "prompt": "If $$\\frac{23}{30}=\\frac1{a_1}+\\frac1{a_2}+\\cdots+\\frac1{a_n},$$ where $a_1,a_2,\\dots,a_n$ are natural numbers, then the smallest value of $n$ is",
