      {
        "title": "Compare ratios",
        "body": "$\\dfrac bc=\\dfrac{1997^2}{1996\\cdot1998}=\\dfrac{1997^2}{1997^2-1}>1$, so $b>c$. $\\dfrac ab=\\dfrac{1996^2\\cdot1998}{1995\\cdot1997^2}=\\dfrac{1996^2}{1996^2-1}\\cdot\\dfrac{1998}{1997}>1$, so $a>b$. Hence $c<b<a$.\n\n**Answer: (B) $c<b<a$**"
