        "title": "Allowed cut positions",
        "body": "Let the string have length 1. The longer piece is at least 3 times the shorter exactly when the shorter piece is at most $\\frac14$, i.e. the cut is within $\\frac14$ of one of the two ends. That is $\\frac14+\\frac14=\\frac12$ of the string.\n\n**Answer: (D) $\\frac12$**"
